{"id":"dbde69396a089d39","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-successor-limit-ordinal.md","title":"后继与极限序数","display":"df-successor-limit-ordinal — 后继与极限序数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal","aliases":["18-df-successor-limit-ordinal","18-df-019"],"display":"df-successor-limit-ordinal — 后继与极限序数","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]","[[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"3.2.6","source_printed_pages":"22–23","source_pdf_pages":"32–33","source_correspondence":"definition-correspondence","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-successor-limit-ordinal</span><span>18-df-019</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-successor-limit-ordinal — 后继与极限序数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f91b518237a8b\" href=\"?note=592f91b518237a8b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-comparison\">18-df-ordinal-comparison</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.2.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"22–23"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"32–33"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"definition-correspondence"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha,\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>，比较见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f91b518237a8b\" href=\"?note=592f91b518237a8b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-comparison\">18-df-ordinal-comparison</a>；序数类与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\omega\">\\(0,\\omega\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{succ}\">\\(\\operatorname{succ}\\)</span> 为序数类函数缩写；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lim}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lim}\\)</span> 为可定义类，非集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\alpha\\cup\\{\\alpha\\},\n\\qquad \\alpha&#39;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\alpha\\cup\\{\\alpha\\},\n\\qquad \\alpha&#39;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lim}\\coloneqq\\{\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\n\\lambda\\ne0\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\lambda\\;\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha)&lt;\\lambda\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Lim}\\coloneqq\\{\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\n\\lambda\\ne0\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\lambda\\;\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha)&lt;\\lambda\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\omega=\\min\\mathrm{Lim}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\omega=\\min\\mathrm{Lim}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Definition 3.2.6；补出后继构造，以免加法用未定义的“β+1”定义自身。最小极限序数等于最小归纳集由自然数归纳及序数比较得出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"592f91b518237a8b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"592f91b518237a8b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，比较见 [[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]；序数类与 $0,\\omega$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，比较见 [[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]；序数类与 $0,\\omega$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{succ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lim}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\alpha\\cup\\{\\alpha\\},\n\\qquad \\alpha'\\coloneqq\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lim}\\coloneqq\\{\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\n\\lambda\\ne0\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\lambda\\;\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha)<\\lambda\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega=\\min\\mathrm{Lim}.","display":true}],"bytes":1396,"backlinks":[{"id":